Hi Alex and Finn,

Thank you for the UAT round 2 feedback. We have fixed the signature flow and =
the expired results on matched and unlinked refunds, and added a few more imp=
rovements along the way. Everything is in Vesopa EPOS 1.16.3 and Customer Dis=
play 1.6.22.

What changed:
- Signature: the till keeps checking the machine during the signature. If Doj=
o accepts it after 80 seconds, the real result shows.
- Paid means paid: if the card was charged, the sale is recorded as paid what=
ever button was pressed. Rejected only shows when Dojo declines.
- Refunds: matched and unlinked refunds now run like payments: signature prom=
pt, Cancel and the full result screen.
- Expired results: shows Check status, Record and Try again, and keeps asking=
 Dojo every 5 seconds for 5 minutes.
- Failed payments: failed card payments get their own tab on the till and in =
the back office, with Dojo's reference and reason.
- Customer display: Display 1.6.22 shows card refunds too, as well as the pay=
ment status full screen.

LIVE ON THE MICROSOFT STORE
All of our Windows apps have been updated and are published on the Microsoft =
Store today:
- Vesopa EPOS 1.16.3
- Vesopa Customer Display 1.6.22
- Vesopa Kitchen 1.7.6
- Vesopa Express 1.0.13
This release also reads member cards and QR codes at the till, closes the app=
s straight away on Exit, and makes secure connections more reliable on new PC=
s.

